      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA INVINCIBLE (1) proved too good on debut over 407m at Rockhampton to score by 4 lengths (24.05). Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Rates a top chance again. CANYA SEE ME (2) hit the ground running to score by 6 lengths (23.86) at Rockhampton over 407m. Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Harder here but expected to feature again. OHTANI MAGIC (3) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Blow Bayou (31.05) in a Grade 5/6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to be in the finish again. EQUAL IMPACT (8) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (25.97) in a Grade 6 at this track last time out.",
